# `pipelines.patch`

Apply RFC-6902 ops to a pipeline definition.

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.pipelines.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `name` | `string` |
| `patch_json` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |

## Returns

`ScopedMutation` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call pipelines.patch --json '{ "name": "", "patch_json": "", "scope": "" }'
```

Kind: command.

## Example response

```json
{
  "id": "ship-feature",
  "scope": "project"
}
```
